//! Real libuv children, isolated synchronous pumping, and unreferenced signals.
//! Stdio ownership transfers to JS only after spawn succeeds. Teardown never kills children.
//! Host operations:
//! spawn/spawnSync(file, argvNul, envNul, cwd, fds, flags, uid, gid, callback/input, timeout, maxBuffer, killSignal).
//! Async returns [id,pid,...ownedParentFds], or a negative uv error; exit callback(code,signal).
//! Sync returns [uvError,pid,exitCode,signal,...capturedArrayBuffers], or a negative spawn error.
//! fds use -1 for socketpair pipes, -2 for ignore, and nonnegative inherited descriptors.
//! kill(id,signal), ref(id), unref(id); signalStart(signal,callback)->id, signalStop(id).
//! ipcOpen(fd,callback)->id takes ownership on success; callback(events,fd), events use UV_READABLE/WRITABLE.
//! ipcRead(fd)->[ArrayBuffer,receivedFd] or negative uv error; ipcWrite(fd,buffer,offset,length,sendFd)->bytes/error.
//! ipcEvents(id,events), ipcClose(id), closeFd(fd), errorName(status). IPC sendFd is borrowed.
